 "note": {
  "h": "Tae · 태 · Lake",
  "p": "Tae is a lake with a calm surface and real depth below it. The form asks for steady breathing and an even temper: soft outside, firm inside. It builds on Il Jang with the front stance, the high punch and the kick-and-punch combination."
 },
 "footer": "Move counting follows the Kukkiwon convention, where a kick and the strike that follows it share one number (8-1, 8-2). Finish with <b>Baro</b>: turn to face ga and return to the ready stance at the starting point.",
